[gd_scene load_steps=18 format=3]

; zone_broken_gate — the undead mountain in the snow (WLD-05; rebuilt for the map themes,
; 2026-09-23), band 15–19.
;
; A mountain pass under snow, cut in two by an old curtain wall with a broken gate. West of it the
; dead rise from a graveyard and a field of open graves, and a yeti walks the northern pass; the
; wall is held by frost casters. East of it a haunted graveyard, and at the far end the mausoleum
; that leads down into the catacombs — watched by the lich who raised them, from a ring of rune
; stones and cold fires. Three frost-rune stones, the map's shards, stand in the snow.
;
; Everything the player walks on or into is a kit piece naming an id; woods and clutter are
; ScatterNodes, seeded. Every creature is tuning in game/data/zones/act1.json. This file is
; coordinates. Generated by a script; edit the script, not this file.

